~ day2
Letter: Dear Folly, with how that event went down, I'm going to have to put our friendship on pause. IT ISN'T OVER YET! I just think we need some space to cool off and get our heads back on right. We can go back to being friends right after.
Letter: Signed, A Former Friend
=> END

~ day3
Letter: Dear Folly, ever since the car crash, I've despised every fiber of your being. You murdered my parents, and at my lowest, you used it to take everything I ever had, even my love. I'll never forgive you for what you've done. I hate you. I hate you.
Letter: Signed, Mercury.
=> END

